    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="A quadratic whose two coordinates differ in curvature by a factor of 1000. Fixed-step gradient descent must use a step small enough for the stiff coordinate, so it crawls along the flat one. Adam rescales each coordinate by its root-mean-square gradient and moves both at a similar speed.">

